Well, I've had several requests for the Osborne I termcap.  Normally, I wouldn't
ship it out to the net--but our wierd topology has guaranteed that 3 out of 5
responses I've tried to send out get scotched.  To those who requested this and
didn't get an individual answer, I'm terribly soorry; I feel like I'm trying to talk
over a series of diodes, rather than a computer net.  To others who'd rather not see
this, sorry; but there is a need and interest in this.

As an aside, be careful; it may sound like an anomaly on the Osborne, but with the
80-column upgrade, it's too easy to enter lines >80 columns!  I've already had
several comments...

					Disgruntledly,

